sequenceDiagram
  participant R as Recipient Browser
  participant A as API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Private S3
  R->>A: GET /v1/public/transfers/token
  A->>D: Check READY + not expired
  alt Password protected
    A-->>R: Password challenge (no file metadata)
    R->>A: POST unlock password
    A-->>R: Short-lived scoped grant
  else Unprotected
    A-->>R: Safe file metadata
  end
  R->>A: POST download-urls (selected IDs)
  A->>D: Recheck READY, expiry, grant
  A-->>R: Short-lived signed GET URLs
  R->>S: Direct signed GET file bytes
